<h2>Availability of Survey Results</h2>
<p>
Detailed historical statistics for 1953&#8211;98 can be obtained from NSF's Industrial Research and Development Information System (IRIS) at <a href="/5902/20181004234711/https://www.nsf.gov/statistics/iris/">http://www.nsf.gov/statistics/iris/</a>, an online interface to the Survey of Industrial Research and Development Historical Database (SIRDHD) (<a href="content.cfm?pub_id=3956&amp;id=2#nsf2001b">NSF 2001b</a>). The SIRDHD is a collection of more than 2,500 statistical tables containing all of the statistics produced and published from the 1953&#8211;98 cycles of the annual Survey of Industrial Research and Development. Statistics for 1991&#8211;2007 are available in the separate reports at <a href="/5902/20181004234711/https://www.nsf.gov/statistics/industry/">http://www.nsf.gov/statistics/industry/</a>.
</p>


